        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋol da loerai esasedoti lopeti koinacanake, loebukokinitai akinyet nakinyonyoanakina akouke, loetiakunitai ainap inapen, mam ŋol elakari itima luka akouke, karaida aicil inapeneke: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
